        "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"data:,\"><title>Swordsman whole-master review</title>\n<style>\nbody{margin:24px;background:#14232c;color:#edf1ea;font:16px system-ui}main{max-width:1200px;margin:auto}h1{font-size:24px}.controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:18px 0}label{display:grid;gap:5px}select,button,input{font:inherit;padding:7px}canvas{background:#aaa;display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto}#master{width:768px}#runtime{width:240px;image-rendering:pixelated}#runtime.zoom{width:720px}.warning{color:#f2c67b}a{color:#9dd9f7}#status{white-space:pre-wrap}aside{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:start;flex-wrap:wrap}#reference{width:200px;height:auto;background:white}button{cursor:pointer}\n</style>\n</head><body data-ready=\"true\" data-frame=\"2\"><main><h1>Swordsman \u00b7 complete Walk SW master</h1>\n<p class=\"warning\">Candidate review. Other views, anatomical contacts, cutouts and gameplay have not passed.</p>\n<p>Sixteen actual Mesh2Motion poses. Every whole master uses the same crop, scale and root. No independently assembled limbs.</p>\n<div class=\"controls\"><label>Playback<select id=\"speed\"><option value=\"0\">Paused</option><option value=\"1\">Native motion timing</option><option value=\"0.25\">Quarter speed</option></select></label><button id=\"previous\">Previous frame</button><button id=\"next\">Next frame</button><button id=\"replay\">Play complete cycle</button><label>Background<select id=\"background\"><option value=\"#bcbcbc\">Gray</option><option value=\"#f3f3f3\">Light</option><option value=\"#132530\">Dark</option></select></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"guide\">Guide overlay</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"onion\">Previous frame overlay</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"root\">Root marker</label></div>\n<label>Frame <input id=\"frame\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" value=\"0\"><output id=\"frame-label\">2 / 15</output></label>\n<p id=\"status\" role=\"status\">Walk \u00b7 SW \u00b7 source 5f \u00b7 painted frame 2\nAll 16 masters predecoded \u00b7 104.1667 ms \u00b7 one fixed 768 canvas \u2192 240 raster\nWHOLE_MASTER_CANDIDATE_NOT_RUNTIME_ADMITTED \u00b7 overlay tools do not change the underlying masters</p>\n<canvas id=\"master\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\" aria-label=\"Whole painted master at fixed authoring coordinates\"></canvas>\n<h2>Runtime raster \u00b7 240 \u00d7 240</h2><p>Same frame and root, one uniform reduction. Display zoom changes only CSS size.</p>\n<button id=\"zoom\">Toggle 3\u00d7 display zoom</button><canvas id=\"runtime\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\" aria-label=\"Native runtime raster\"></canvas>\n<h2>Protected design reference</h2><aside><img id=\"reference\" alt=\"Original tall Swordsman design; not a replacement animation\" src=\"http://127.0.0.1:8769/authoring/characters/factory-v3/patch-0.0.1/research/swordsman-walk-ip-baseline-reference-20261104/reference.png\"><p>Reference shown for design only. Original protected files remain intact.</p></aside>\n<p><a id=\"normal\" href=\"http://127.0.0.1:8769/authoring/characters/factory-v3/patch-0.0.1/painted-candidates/swordsman-walk-sw-color-guide-20261104/review/normal.gif\">Native timing GIF</a> \u00b7 <a id=\"slow\" href=\"http://127.0.0.1:8769/authoring/characters/factory-v3/patch-0.0.1/painted-candidates/swordsman-walk-sw-color-guide-20261104/review/slow.gif\">Slow GIF</a> \u00b7 <a id=\"receipt\" href=\"http://127.0.0.1:8769/authoring/characters/factory-v3/patch-0.0.1/painted-candidates/swordsman-walk-sw-color-guide-20261104/review/receipt.json\">Coordinates and open gates</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"character-factory.html\">Retained layered factory</a></p>\n</main><script src=\"swordsman-master-review.js\"></script>\n</body></html>",
